CRAN-SUBMISSION
# cran-comments.md is deliberately TRACKED. It is excluded from the built
# tarball by .Rbuildignore, so tracking it cannot reach CRAN; what it buys is a
# diff, a history, and a copy on the backup mirror. Untracked, it drifted eleven
# releases without anyone seeing it happen (RURL-ladruqhn).
report.html
LOCAL_WORKFLOW_NOTES.md

# HTML widget assets (generated; excluded from package build via .Rbuildignore)
/lib/

# Fiberplane local issue tracking
.fp/
.positai
